2. EXCEPTION — CIRCUIT DATA (Open Database License)
===============================================================================

Section 1 does NOT apply to the file `f1replay/ui/circuits.py`.

That file is not the author's work to restrict. It is a derived database
generated from the f1-circuits GeoJSON dataset
(https://github.com/bacinger/f1-circuits), itself derived from OpenStreetMap:

    Circuit geometry © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the
    Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0.
    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
    https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

It remains available under the ODbL, which is a share-alike licence: you may
use and redistribute that data, and databases derived from it, provided you
attribute OpenStreetMap contributors and license any derived database under
the ODbL. This obligation runs with the data and is unaffected by the
reservation of rights in Section 1.

